  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Gujarat Cooperative Milk Marketing ... vs Deepa Devi & Ors on 1 July, 2024 Author: Manmeet Pritam Singh Arora Bench: Manmeet Pritam Singh Arora $~19 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New Delhi + Cs(Os) 499/2024 Gujarat Cooperative Milk Marketing Feder Limited .. Through: Mr. Sunil Dalal, Sr Mr. Abhishek Singh, Anand, Ms. Alisha S Amal Anand and Mr. and Mr. Shashwat Ty ve Deepa Devi & Ors. Through: Coram: Hon'Ble Ms. Justice Manmeet Pritam Singh Arora Order % 01.07.2024 I.A. 31787/2024 (for exemption) 1.",
    "facts": "The authenticity of the order can be re-verified from Delhi High Court Order Portal by scanning the QR code shown above. 6. The summons shall indicate that the written statement(s) must be filed within 30 days from the date of receipt of the summons. The defendant nos. 1 and 2 shall also file affidavits of admission/denial of the documents filed by the plaintiff, failing which the written statement(s) shall not be taken on record. 7. The plaintiff is at liberty to file replication(s) thereto within 15 days after filing of the written statements.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
